{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:74546ea469cc6d78e0a11f0876ba93efed024cb0714c12b98a9e30c0c4c7d4bd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:003c676e2a2d7c57799cccfd90a5d8bb3a30a0b37936330e8b607a01c91e1520",
      "text": "为了改变世界",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4911cafee33e644aa012fc7cb9e4865b3cedd4ed7676cfce6bfbd3b571abb79c",
      "text": "作为“著名学生会长”之一大显身手的秀，把下次要在活动中发布的新曲放给好友听。面对让同为天才的好友都为之震惊的高完成度，秀感受到了切实的信心。他本以为只要与好友一起，连世界都能改变，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:003c676e2a2d7c57799cccfd90a5d8bb3a30a0b37936330e8b607a01c91e1520",
      "text": "为了改变世界",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06595cca08b95c1a2d78550742281771b3ff6a2b38b03ec6d2cd9b20edca3fb7",
      "text": "那么，预算就这么定下来了。\n关于下一个议题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5334b68c83254aefb38c813687864f449329746b72af7562a3392e61766e159",
      "text": "啊，这个问题交给我来处理就好。\n所以，今天的学生会干部会议就到此……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0608096b745713df7462d775c14365b528307639ac7fdf446fa5e79d268cdb6",
      "text": "啊，天峰，这样好吗？\n你不是还有学生会长的工作吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be06b22c6a2caf0be2b077aa4a264072c643c48e14dd1879868f99d91024586c",
      "text": "这种善后工作也是学生会长的工作的一部分啦。\n学长们不用放在心上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2af08bffdc556767dd58b441df9f864d56047cb4da8820bd8ab31c681dfcf44",
      "text": "明白了。\n不好意思啊，这次也拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0f82b592f56881c4c1c2d56ee2c7ea09fdb124376868b725f1c786982276d79",
      "text": "今天，这就结束了吧。……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdcd3ab8dd3349af75dab9a24a2b004d00685726a31456f9c0b36a1bf25070ef",
      "text": "喂，现在回家吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd320b8d726fdf27d70ae556b05ea80345158313998f1d607eda5a3784b3de0f",
      "text": "是秀啊。学生会的工作结束了吗……不对，\n不用问也知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d63a25165570c6da1093bc024e42f36032111f3a473ca681a2ce3ef8308531d",
      "text": "当然。比起那个，去我家坐坐吧？\n那首新歌做好了，放给你听听。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de97855c7e6bf4567ecb6ba5df08a4be5605fd3a519620be316c92aa91f1cebe",
      "text": "嘿，已经做好了吗。\n我还以为得花更久呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38205b0635376d11cd9e473f67722e6cdc625db18c8798b4cec28c67bc189b2a",
      "text": "好厉害啊，那两个人。是“著名学生会长”天峰秀和\n他的天才好友搭档吧？周围的气场都不一样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ae39c049079cea20b5c58ee9fc9543a3f8bd919158930d8f5a13e5308a51fcc",
      "text": "两个人成绩和运动都出类拔萃，什么都会！\n到底怎么做才能变成那种人呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef8f1e31c8467728b4c8fa74211a3d722659cd5a36daacc78cd44c94b9b54f3",
      "text": "秀的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5324b171b9f764f43a29e6878a311a517981dc1ab9df8717e8f9c7657555233",
      "text": "怎么样？完成度挺高的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9c2d2991ccda01132ddd15f3a327260b19f4ba0211fc3c10c8cff0466b9424",
      "text": "我参考了你的建议。\n托你的福变成一首好歌了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eed0ae2d5e5a6d50c15762813e5180205aefda77c5837b149b15eda7ec9c5609",
      "text": "来，你看看。\n评论区已经被感想给淹没了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f84816dd918e34494dc988e4ac1688eddfbbf6252696cc2d06d11015846d23b6",
      "text": "“果然是天才！”“超出了预期”吗。\n简直是一片赞赏的狂潮啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e11d9aa04284f3a97087db8022ad09630f1c1fb1e3bb6b4ab3e48f744baf504",
      "text": "嘛，毕竟是我的歌，\n受到好评也是理所当然的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b860a22c51510fa9ab4216ede632f54405dd3cd67bb0dc0fc977d276252a7ad",
      "text": "也是，真不愧是秀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24d07361a8cac5d6f1100af6174a75a6ff6aa5088c399bae8ff0232ef8e2c547",
      "text": "下次活动，是要把之前的歌打包一起出吧？\n感觉又会很热闹了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce3463996cc34bb3d145926637117008ff5415d2794b964429043a48391873a3",
      "text": "啊，好好期待吧。\n你也要来帮我摆摊卖唱片哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c00ebe05cb715d2839fe9f66e7dccaff146e095068f0106ec640d11274c7891a",
      "text": "（……跟这家伙待在一起很开心）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad312a940905f15aefbe2a69e8bc545eab50fd99a8f30e2d70f7d96f5ccdb228",
      "text": "（只要两个人一起，用音乐，\n连世界肯定都能改变）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:526e7222f07f59c4a7bb677ab13dfd54e507970040f0851aba64c91ea95ce949",
      "text": "（说起来……我开始做音乐，\n也是因为这家伙才开始的来着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0851405f447665eeb814940ff85c8ebf3cc42342556229bb0286073d32875de3",
      "text": "怎么样，秀。这首歌？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a39c9bf72930092f30a37f406873777a52fe61fa8b7a3e930a5372f473d9d146",
      "text": "嘿，挺不错的嘛。\n特别是副歌部分，朗朗上口很容易记住。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78994357eb8588c5ebae084d2d3245b40901e14b3b0180370e398d3be3de50a4",
      "text": "对吧？这个网站有很多好歌，\n我觉得你肯定会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a09a035e873aa20c916775797099ee67671ecb73f3138afdaea08ae97d76056",
      "text": "（……确实不算差，不过）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ff9592eab13d44bd3402e6968994e1896e573983c59ae1ebe1d99cee52b8cdb",
      "text": "（要是我的话，会把调再升一点，\n把主旋律给突出来……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:524ff1df66e23777f202c4b1e70b9f899f3a59e49956922b571c6064cedb5d23",
      "text": "（这个……要是我的话，是不是能做出\n更好的东西来？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000066:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99f2b6c56cc16ed337dbedd63833ea552f8f5130c26879371829d5761e5559ff",
      "text": "喂。来听一下这个看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c62530f7f27e15a7e8fd6a08e68b89397c03ede5a0cce53a770d5d98ce75b4c",
      "text": "……喂，这是谁的歌啊？\n挖到很厉害的东西了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db181fec841aaec6b2674f348c9c6077356236e8896f2ac55d13237880f996bf",
      "text": "哼，是我哦。……怎么样？\n是不是想说点别的感想了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:426bb51f394463031027783bb7f47dbb9bf7362c9deff6092494e94709d7a91b",
      "text": "太吃惊了……\n没想到你连这种才能都有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daf76cdd54830ec90df5fac0b3c80b9139bdb3039442f25b393d72eb514aaff6",
      "text": "对吧？乐坛新星降临了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2e0cbf566a18c45d4ce4e94f7b11130758ebb350a84dff5a39664cbf6a994a6",
      "text": "想起让人怀念的事情了。\n我第一次写歌时的对话，你还记得吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e82e7ed294e8a8a5e1fc79b3721a813975207a5bc553a0eeda7d7f6557c4001c",
      "text": "嗯？……啊，是重新确认了\n天峰秀是个天才的那天的事情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7213d3a738fdd120945eb4b4e8810dac249fb9488174dc5d9a16c8bbd71ea247",
      "text": "毕竟是让你久违地露出笑容的一天嘛。\n怎么可能忘得了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d62079561a4e66024e9ab8e70559351d5a077d03ee1e9880dd1c0218efe1e7e",
      "text": "我笑了吗？\n……不，怎么可能啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3f6a7e2d1ea11864242e8ca8e795c78bc69256ca7c50711b2ed2a9723db5f87",
      "text": "搞什么嘛，你没好好记着吗？\n不过，那个时候，多少打发了你的无聊吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62ccfe5680fae149a62f79a2e8976c251c44684d31dd6807850b2d25b4880b8c",
      "text": "看好吧。无论是我们无聊的人生，还是这个世界。\n总有一天我要用我的音乐，把它们变成有趣的东西！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f90c938df903b50648c80212c3228f4660cb08bfca8c64bb0d2640657a4ae617",
      "text": "……是啊。\n要是你的话，说不定真的能做到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e038446c65e72e44ba8670808fd1891313debd8e5e2f54a85d97c00e1304a6f0",
      "text": "不是说不定，是一定能做到啦。\n我的才能，你不是最清楚了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:845a61696602c27681c65a470b07eeb1c1113d5bd4d8b0fa616f791aa4d47b13",
      "text": "哈哈，确实是呢。失礼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53889f78e15b3b85d66953861874344c669413b1214b8d9d017601a923b07dcc",
      "text": "你可别当成事不关己啊。\n你也要和我一起，去改变这个世界哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af6e5c1bffb639b62488f1fdab1e018667975468a32df444f67cf81b70a0bdba",
      "text": "啊啊，那听起来挺有意思的。\n这样暂时就不会觉得无聊了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81b9bfff7ff210ff80719f034e362c12681d257e113a76a3916bf38702aaf164",
      "text": "下一首歌，我打算做成这种感觉的。\n不过，开头想做得更加流行一点……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f61722d0c14ce1593cd129202469f9a4540deceb277bf2bf830868085c73ac4",
      "text": "喂，你在听吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8a34c3e696974af02166b1a846ac009e09b1fb34bcec9026326ec5187ccab62",
      "text": "……嗯，在听。\n你真的很厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16437b8a627734eb1604dc3870dc5b06c6c512a011d96670f4632f95dd79fb10",
      "text": "？搞什么啊，心不在焉的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c21e64a693723626cdcd479ddc198e0f2996b270676b86253b0ac7f96e15ded3",
      "text": "平时的劲头去哪了？\n除了“很厉害”之外应该还有别的话可说吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a47c35d0b527ec8d08461d2a5aba26b8935bfc5133ca05e81296abe193e8c43",
      "text": "啊，也是呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c80cdaecb11dfc261a8cfee980d941df10aa7214fb48ce9ddea7294602f327",
      "text": "赶紧去改变世界吧。\n赶在我无聊死之前啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b3db3551765d189bc9a79826d8c2f434fd1251f8c54661bceb78248ad6d0b3a",
      "text": "我知道了啦。\n你不是知道我没有什么事情是做不到的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd11ff36c704afe4fd923a3cbe9ae05b9dcbb0770dbd913092b2825f66ead5fd",
      "text": "……是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0e7209531d8aba3dc16d5e80497efec4fc737c4802e7b472140d0c9c9834dcf",
      "text": "秀的话，没有什么做不到的。\n跟我不同。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe371da66d1edd3fd7cf00400587c04dbb4b59ee1b9b57b97e4f70326212d5f5",
      "text": "那家伙……今天也没来学校吗。\n这都第几天了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e969ea5d5a9ba5d224bf55cc7b98313ad21afd0e1e9cf09922811cdb6f511f13",
      "text": "（打电话不接，\n发信息也不显示已读）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69f1113141f4dc3881328c25b668227ce4f603bd604e580b470b0052d1b6d29b",
      "text": "（去他家也不出来……\n明明知道我去了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4723af777f54e8acef6443a0f5ecbafa9890a38978b03982d0702b819d6b3cf",
      "text": "怎么了啊，挚友……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cae4c360cb8705b0b4672862a0922eceb90042bba701d2d35b69d0225d6aab75",
      "text": "（最后一次说话的时候，就很奇怪呢。\n不是平时的状态）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c951ed0bd27cfb9c45c4894de71d24901356dd12d1144237914790f9a1010202",
      "text": "（那时候，那家伙说了什么？\n理由一定就在那里）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c80cdaecb11dfc261a8cfee980d941df10aa7214fb48ce9ddea7294602f327",
      "text": "赶紧去改变世界吧。\n赶在我无聊死之前啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b74e5cce9444880891057ea78053d5f3fee93aa4531ef859cf060a43d1fe9c4",
      "text": "……搞什么啊。因为无聊，就把一切都抛开了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1d1d8410e0b25dae9e2b66d1ec44cb57076dfa3e98249a3aeca3f48058e4241",
      "text": "（什么都能做到的人会觉得无聊，这我也懂。\n但就算是那样，也不用自暴自弃吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_f:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bbbe188f95513fa83188616ebeb7b24a51337544d0ad44bef82b1138fc45ec8",
      "text": "……就由我，来把那家伙的无聊彻底轰飞！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eac3a40fc07710d441025c7f019e77f8c451a36bc6677b154f3b53ed164681e",
      "text": "活动会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b9002a54664c0a747cd278696287048e160791c4ad2ffe718265baefb6cbe46",
      "text": "（今天的“Sound Verse”，\n本来应该和那家伙一起作为社团参加的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70a7178884c638aedf34ff3e461968d0417219aedc6427e06fda91df6adb4295",
      "text": "（结果，直到今天也一次都没能联系上。\n……喂，你现在，在干什么？不要紧吧？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c36a6cf70c8c74af496736fd390f801235ec02182023bb68540ae7fdafb5fa9a",
      "text": "（……不，现在先集中在活动上吧。\n只要我用音乐改变世界，那家伙也会走出来的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ea6852d8c1c9761b3ef0f01864f62512da775ee1326febe0dd73a7d4fb67c2c",
      "text": "（我要再次，用我的音乐，\n让那家伙发自内心地笑出来！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5179c63188c702a06a763beebf39a2c885d92f91867d04c5223b843ef82a91ce",
      "text": "秀君！这次的新歌也太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c9b215ff22a1de47c61d3afb4159bfb197665aed63a5c91871b9ea5a454466c",
      "text": "说什么呢，是我的歌那当然棒啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:700ff90f321a11fed1ec964887f67ee60ad7ac681a1dc2d3eebedf5d0a3c8e0c",
      "text": "……嗯？你不是昨天，在公园遇到的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a44acefae215f6a247eb58d13660a772f40f8aa55ba103b7ff037f6469a1570",
      "text": "昨天没能向您打招呼，真是抱歉。\n这是我的名片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfcf2c08d471eb2757a69c9fe09329fdbe167fce3a96cb2062b0c215358c0aba",
      "text": "315 Production，偶像事务所……？\n嘿，是来发掘我的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33e2b21f5c12b05ce9a77e47acaf86d0e79bf9d7ef2c4a56d911da3f8fbd16b6",
      "text": "秀……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30ea4a6705510ee98e7a6cbd46ec41913282f6f57acd36c278b541117f8eb5c0",
      "text": "喂，你听我说！\n我今天，被发掘去当偶像了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce587bc62547c10a224d82a28449c95b103d754303d6ddda96cd80cd1c5d2289",
      "text": "这可是个绝佳的机会。\n是改变世界的一大步！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3de257bbddb0de4db24680040e33ea54085cb8c4f9e785fc81daabec2a414097",
      "text": "我保证。我……为了你，\n会动真格去改变这个世界的！所以，你也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fe890a6bdaba16deeb688c87652f6773d05ec23e9b9f85d6300fdc17d78d04",
      "text": "……已经够了啦，那种事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6f75f7944c53b28c2f9d8493adb8d978674eca7d33417af1e866c3eacd32e33",
      "text": "秀……你什么事都能做到完美无缺。\n不管是学习、运动还是作曲，所有的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e19c499dc2d1b2b51f0a25183ad1801a3656fffdde17c8b5fd8ed74b3da7eba",
      "text": "但我，并不是那样。\n上了高中之后，成绩也一直在下滑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c3ebae9bffc07043dbef6a019b3a6f28793c23cc1d1635409915b7275a9bb1b",
      "text": "你虽然说着“一起改变世界”之类的话，\n但我根本没有那样的力量。你的背影，太遥远了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38dd7873e2787469ccc9d31b66fc948ce8d9c00f6f68ad82583db817c5de6ee4",
      "text": "其实……和你在一起，我一直都很痛苦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91a218fe53751f9c1d120b86f71a496325296e3b3d72414489f2877a507426c0",
      "text": "……搞什么啊，那是。\n为什么，为什么之前不告诉我啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c23fb783fa7ca086cd39946f9e94ed0c72e34010738290ce712a774f8b0fb669",
      "text": "……为什么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e83d885a09df41d11397c7228b85263502f0bbf7bd51f417ee2af313557e4d78",
      "text": "既不是世界，也不是学校。\n是我一直在伤害那家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3fcf9f55f4990f77a9d249b3bbd518296246c48666c58f9a7ee3b11aaed7d6",
      "text": "口口声声喊着要改变世界，\n我其实，眼里只有我自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b2e5722647391a4b4dbd6b1ecdd3478401b309e5e38812e54b607f6bbd9cf5",
      "text": "连离我最近的家伙的事，\n都根本没能看清……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5f1dfa5043fed1c37df4ac4c6d40c91eecc040a0f6a7acfd5a201a5dae3548b",
      "text": "……只靠我一个人是不行的。\n可能还会再次失败。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da236eac375c4885158261c7a23c8508e728fadb3339d6fb8d72a08649aed698",
      "text": "为了那家伙。\n为了改变世界，我需要同伴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f5271e82f864d617811dfec8fa5476fb50a0fcb84b609809a494085f63627bb",
      "text": "既然这样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ae8e99896a894415da3aa6111645b7509223c573e570a11e114b4cbea8ca202",
      "text": "……我是前几天被你发掘的天峰。\n……我有事想跟你商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000064:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:405f6f896e3f84d3c1bd1d7d33aa28bb00d912b10481cfa4e25dc6ae0c9d9840",
      "text": "315 Production",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0932786c93e7c83f1bd919bf75aab1368d514adff7a40357770a5b7bd2f6241a",
      "text": "我明白了。\n只要我帮得上忙，一定会尽全力协助的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d95c22ddf789d077fd6ca8dc97c587d198808d8ad69f8c95f08f86e741d0ac44",
      "text": "真的吗！……太感谢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_i:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:174742184b88317bd572103e6b91bc17cc1bd8194ad70df2a8ed9eda1c5df353",
      "text": "我已经……只有你能依靠了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de00942ab69a4a13a1f69b35ed29a56acfba8dade6c9803957377d25e91142b2",
      "text": "关于之前听说的发掘“著名学生会长”中\n另外两位的这件事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a282aa2a5d592c78510d7e15ad25369291a065d4d3286b476061a550c8dea0e",
      "text": "由我们直接闯进学校里去什么的，\n果然还是挺难办的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0767ac72a340ee20b81e68c9e8a49243e9280cb36d049de87ec910756d567d59",
      "text": "是啊。就像见秀先生的时候那样，\n在学校以外的地方相遇是最理想的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf25d8d59e68e1a3ec3495c109abf2e31c6e6a29845141d73d6a79aa4367663e",
      "text": "但是，在学校以外什么的，\n那种事只能指望偶然了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bd9e7e11f8aca346704844211a2c97d33d90c50de3bb2c0c887ec5d18980405",
      "text": "没有那回事！秀先生除了我之外，\n不是还有很多可以依靠的伙伴吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d15db60a08152adb96309b4aa10540fe5e0916bd3738b644edaf12b774adf57f",
      "text": "手机……？\n对啊，在社交平台上，借助我的粉丝们的力量的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:887b4bed946a370b543ab683c6acdf3f0343d2473f3abfc683d88abdb72348f1",
      "text": "（像这样依靠别人还是头一次。\n但是……现在可不是顾虑帅不帅气的时候）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca53d7a127f7275df57360bf62257fe57c272fd17b934b9c5acec86fe33727a1",
      "text": "（你可是个天才吧，天峰秀。\n既然这样，就用行动证明出来啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b34e20992db630785d57234f9ba5ce45e67ea21cbad3806dcd9c4699f0b0ca8f",
      "text": "明白了。我向大家呼吁一下试试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ae21aa57e8f9906295ba9fdd6f73b4bdfceba7fca8ffd55ebf36ddac78a14f2",
      "text": "……来了！\n两个人好像都在涩谷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc28b8b5f1f4d09e458a16d2bb76d0678fd53ee8607e935a7210fd2b66dd2f37",
      "text": "好多人都说看到了锐心学长和百百人学长。\n现在去的话应该能遇上吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebba2d17afaff877eff96135ae3b25cbceb1e1d9abdadc7f4c3af0db793b34b8",
      "text": "我们现在立刻赶过去吧。秀先生和粉丝们\n给予的这次机会，绝对不能错过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2ccffb128dccc202de969b4e7bfc4d73fbc724983d87473b76e0143e8dac03a",
      "text": "就得这样嘛。\n见到他们俩之后，就由我们来发掘！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
